      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I often feel this would be a good feature. How I think it could work is you could give a \"tether request\" to a friend, if they don't accept within some time limit then it should auto accept. \n\nThen there should be some visual tether between the two players, if you move too far apart, say 5 meters, then the other player should be dragged along. Should work through portals as well.\n\nUseful if a friend falls asleep or is afk but the group is moving somewhere else. Or when exploring a large map, having to constantly hold the thumbstick and navigate can get unnecessarily tedious.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
